{"root":"protes","ipa":"/pro.tɛs/","core":"指对某事表示不满、反对或抗议，通常指公开表达异议。","pos":["名词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/pro.tɛs/","zh":"抗议；反对","phrases":[{"t":"melakukan protes","zh":"进行抗议"},{"t":"surat protes","zh":"抗议信"},{"t":"aksi protes","zh":"抗议行动"}],"examples":[{"t":"Para buruh melakukan protes di depan kantor gubernur.","zh":"工人们在省长办公室前进行抗议。"},{"t":"Dia mengajukan protes keras atas keputusan tersebut.","zh":"他针对该决定提出了强烈的抗议。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"protes","ipa":"/pro.tɛs/","zh":"抗议","phrase":{"t":"protes resmi","zh":"正式抗议"},"example":{"t":"Jangan protes terus.","zh":"别一直抱怨。"}},{"w":"memprotes","ipa":"/məm.pro.tɛs/","zh":"抗议某事；反对某事","phrase":{"t":"memprotes kebijakan","zh":"抗议政策"},"example":{"t":"Warga memprotes pembangunan pabrik itu.","zh":"居民们抗议那家工厂的建设。"}},{"w":"pemrotes","ipa":"/pəm.ro.tɛs/","zh":"抗议者","phrase":{"t":"para pemrotes","zh":"抗议者们"},"example":{"t":"Polisi membubarkan para pemrotes.","zh":"警察驱散了抗议者。"}},{"w":"pemrotesan","ipa":"/pəm.ro.tɛ.san/","zh":"抗议行为；抗议过程","phrase":{"t":"proses pemrotesan","zh":"抗议的过程"},"example":{"t":"Pemrotesan itu berlangsung dengan damai.","zh":"那场抗议行为进行得很和平。"}}],"derSlugs":["protes","memprotes","pemrotes","pemrotesan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:47:51.553Z","src":"base"}